{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301130","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301130","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1830113001:1":{"text":"I bet she's just as gorgeous as a Graveborn.","source_cn":"塞涅小姐生前就那么漂亮，变成亡灵肯定有一种别样的美丽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8690D6F1A8D9CF91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830113002:1":{"text":"I doubt Senea has changed much. She only just became a Graveborn.","source_cn":"我认为塞涅刚成为亡灵，我感觉不会有太大的变化。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x075C9FABE131B049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830113003:1":{"text":"She probably has glowing eyes as we do.","source_cn":"应该就跟我们现在一样，双眼发光吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF905E0368900FC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1830113004:1":{"text":"That's for sure. Look around—everyone has glowing eyes.","source_cn":"双眼发光是肯定的，你们看这里的人都是双眼发光的呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x807EC4F34517245B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1830113005:1":{"text":"Yikes, they look kind of creepy up close...","source_cn":"咦惹，细看有点吓人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA916782FE042C357","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1830113006:1":{"text":"Polly, look at me... Awooooo!","source_cn":"波莉，看着我……嗷嗷嗷——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B150930C25A580","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1830113007:1":{"text":"Ahhh! Stop that, Joshe! You scared the life out of me!","source_cn":"啊！吓死人了乔舒亚！不要这样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89AD265C10903CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1830113008:1":{"text":"Hahaha! You're such a chicken! Honestly, I'm surprised you had the guts to come along.","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈，这么胆小还跟着我们跑过来。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD366FA1E4469D412","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hahaha! You're such a chicken! Honestly, I'm surprised you had the guts to come along.","female":"Hahaha! You're such a chicken! Honestly, I'm surprised you had the guts to come along.","variant_male_record_index":"248251","variant_female_record_index":"248252","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1830113009:1":{"text":"Well, anything for Senea!","source_cn":"那还不都是为了见塞涅……！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8B154096807621BD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Well, anything for Senea!","female":"Well, anything for Senea!","variant_male_record_index":"248254","variant_female_record_index":"248255","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docum